{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1428205-a-question-about-the-protean-ability-beast-s-skin","id":1428205,"title":"A question about the Protean ability Beast's Skin","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-12-12T14:17:17-08:00","id":1428205,"title":"A question about the Protean ability Beast's Skin","content":"I'm curious how this ability interacts with the other Protean abilities. For example, let's say I use Beast's Skin to turn into a Bear. The Discipline reads &quot;While in animal form, the vampire can use her Disciplines as normal&quot;. Does this mean I can then use Unnatural Aspect as normal to grow a pair of wings? Can I become a flying Bear?<br /> <br /> What's more, the Devotion &quot;Force of Nature&quot; (p144) reads &quot;the vampire gains as many of the advantages of Predatory Aspect, Beast\u2019s Skin, and Unnatural Aspect as she wishes&quot;. I'm curious what an &quot;advantage&quot; of Beast's Skin is in this context? Could I pick and choose stat changes from my various stored animal forms?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2384-aurumae","name":"Aurumae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2384_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-12T15:26:21-08:00","id":1428216,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aurumae</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1428205-a-question-about-the-protean-ability-beast-s-skin#post1428205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious how this ability interacts with the other Protean abilities. For example, let's say I use Beast's Skin to turn into a Bear. The Discipline reads &quot;While in animal form, the vampire can use her Disciplines as normal&quot;. Does this mean I can then use Unnatural Aspect as normal to grow a pair of wings? Can I become a flying Bear?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aurumae</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1428205-a-question-about-the-protean-ability-beast-s-skin#post1428205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's more, the Devotion &quot;Force of Nature&quot; (p144) reads &quot;the vampire gains as many of the advantages of Predatory Aspect, Beast\u2019s Skin, and Unnatural Aspect as she wishes&quot;. I'm curious what an &quot;advantage&quot; of Beast's Skin is in this context? Could I pick and choose stat changes from my various stored animal forms?</div> </div> </div> </div>For Beast's Skin each separate animal form is its own advantage. But you can change reflexively between forms to gain the advantages of several during a single turn; just not at the same time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-13T02:46:07-08:00","id":1428247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aurumae</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1428205-a-question-about-the-protean-ability-beast-s-skin#post1428205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious how this ability interacts with the other Protean abilities. For example, let's say I use Beast's Skin to turn into a Bear. The Discipline reads &quot;While in animal form, the vampire can use her Disciplines as normal&quot;. Does this mean I can then use Unnatural Aspect as normal to grow a pair of wings? Can I become a flying Bear?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes for the 1st question although the wings are intended to allow an human being to fly at his full speed. A Bear should be far more heavy so someone could argue it's too weight to fly with such wings. But generally speaking, yes. You could have a Bear with unnatural claws, or able to slip within tiny fissures etc.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aurumae</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1428205-a-question-about-the-protean-ability-beast-s-skin#post1428205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's more, the Devotion &quot;Force of Nature&quot; (p144) reads &quot;the vampire gains as many of the advantages of Predatory Aspect, Beast\u2019s Skin, and Unnatural Aspect as she wishes&quot;. I'm curious what an &quot;advantage&quot; of Beast's Skin is in this context? Could I pick and choose stat changes from my various stored animal forms?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. and each turn from a different animal. You could be a Bear with horrid talons, able to crawl on vertical walls and the very next turn a cat, each time moving as many dots from the ones related to the specific form, as you wish.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7079-marcus","name":"Marcus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-13T10:15:51-08:00","id":1428282,"title":"","content":"By a strict reading of the rules I believe you can take as many aspects as you want so all of them would seem to be a valid choice, a flying bear able to squeeze through tight spaces and do lethal damage to vampires seems to be valid.<br /> If I\u2019m wrong please let me know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}